msgstr "set_workspace_multibuffer"

msgid "配置 workspace multi-buffer 档位，用于为 workspace 相关数据搬运启用多缓冲。"
msgstr "Configure the workspace multi-buffer level to enable multi-buffering for workspace-related data transfers."

msgid "默认None；可取单个值，如 2 或 4；autotune中可配置候选值"
msgstr "Default is None; a single value such as 2 or 4 can be used; candidate values can be configured in autotune."

msgid "enable_hivm_auto_cv_balance"
msgstr "enable_hivm_auto_cv_balance"

msgid "启用或禁用自动 CV balance，用于在 CV 融合场景下平衡 Cube 与 Vector 执行。"
msgstr "Enable or disable automatic CV balancing, used to balance Cube and Vector execution in CV fusion scenarios."

msgid "tile_mix_vector_loop"
msgstr "tile_mix_vector_loop"

msgid "CV算子的一个优化项，当前vector可以切几份"
msgstr "An optimization item for the CV operator: how many parts the current vector can be split into."

msgid "默认None；可取单个值，如 2、4 或 8；autotune中可配置候选值"
msgstr "Default is None; can take a single value, such as 2, 4, or 8; candidate values can be configured in autotune."

msgid "tile_mix_cube_loop"
msgstr "tile_mix_cube_loop"

msgid "CV算子一个优化项，当前cube可以切几份"
msgstr "One optimization item for the CV operator: how many parts the current cube can be split into."

msgid "auto_blockify_size"
msgstr "auto_blockify_size"

msgid "TRITON_ALL_BLOCKS_PARALLEL优化项，用于指定扩展的左起第一个维度的大小。"
msgstr "TRITON_ALL_BLOCKS_PARALLEL optimization option, used to specify the size of the first dimension starting from the left of the extension."

msgid "默认1；可取单个整数值，如 2、4 或 8；autotune中可配置候选值"
msgstr "Default is 1; a single integer value can be used, such as 2, 4, or 8; candidate values can be configured in autotune."

msgid "enable_auto_blockify"
msgstr "enable_auto_blockify"

msgid "per-kernel 级别覆盖 `TRITON_ALL_BLOCKS_PARALLEL` 环境变量。显式设为 **true** 或 **false** 时，kernel 按该值生效（忽略环境变量）；未设置（None）时由环境变量决定。优先级：该选项 > 环境变量 > 关。编译期 blockify pass 与运行期 block-count cap 都按此解析后的值生效，二者永远一致。"
msgstr "Per-kernel level override of the `TRITON_ALL_BLOCKS_PARALLEL` environment variable. When explicitly set to **true** or **false**, the kernel takes effect according to that value (ignoring the environment variable); when unset (None), it is determined by the environment variable. Priority: this option > environment variable > off. Both the compile-time blockify pass and the runtime block-count cap take effect according to this resolved value, and the two are always consistent."

msgid "默认 None；可取值 **true** / **false** / None。"
msgstr "Default is None; possible values are **true** / **false** / None."

msgid "注：优化编译选项在ascend/backend/compiler.py代码中。"
msgstr "Note: The optimization compilation options are in the ascend/backend/compiler.py code."

msgid "注：CV算子表示该算子运算过程中既使用了AI Core又使用了Vector Core。"
msgstr "Note: The CV operator indicates that the operator uses both AI Core and Vector Core during its computation process."
